{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Super Scary Halloween Spooky Times: Spit's Quest",
    "steam_appid": 1918490,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918490/extras/74bee190d56e8a779c5205299cb6fa5a.avif?t=1744728079\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome back to another year of late stage capitalism at <strong>Super Scary Halloween Spooky Times</strong>, the #1 holiday store for all your spooky costume needs! Unfortunately, you are not working at the #1 store in the franchise. Probably like #8. We didn't specify a number because it doesn't really matter for gameplay. That much.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What matters most is that your employer, MacEmpire, can and probably will fire you and all of your friends if you do a bad job at selling fine wares this season!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918490/extras/e62e6392d86e045adff4291e4135a482.avif?t=1744728079\" /></div>Step 1) Hunt monsters with your monster hunters (Also: train them first so they don't die)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step 2) Craft them into awesome costumes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step 3) Sell them to people for money</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step 4) PROFIT!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918490/extras/44c3de91dd4a5c249a6f44cfbd953895.avif?t=1744728079\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage a team of 8 Spook Experts (read: grumpy part-time employees) in a world where the economy is run on selling the byproducts of a monster hunt. Don't think about the fact that the cute lil' unicorn costume you just sold was made from the hide of a bloodthirsty creature. That's just weird.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try to deal with customers the best you can! Upsell items! Train your staff! Try to avoid any (big) HR complaints!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Oh, did we mention that you have to do all this while keeping your sanity as the outside world falls further and further into a fascist state? Well, you do! (I don't know why we put an exclamation point right there. That's not funny)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918490/extras/80ebeb550f30a8dd46dde454c17c0211.avif?t=1744728079\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Train and utilize a staff of 8 through five acts of retail doom. Make sure that they have the stats to take on the day!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make sure that your team of 4 monster hunters have everything they need in order to bring home the best monsters the wilds have to offer! You don't want to sell BAD monster hides, now do you?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PC, Linux</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visual Novel with light RPG and Management elements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918490/extras/74bee190d56e8a779c5205299cb6fa5a.avif?t=1744728079\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome back to another year of late stage capitalism at <strong>Super Scary Halloween Spooky Times</strong>, the #1 holiday store for all your spooky costume needs! Unfortunately, you are not working at the #1 store in the franchise. Probably like #8. We didn't specify a number because it doesn't really matter for gameplay. That much.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What matters most is that your employer, MacEmpire, can and probably will fire you and all of your friends if you do a bad job at selling fine wares this season!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918490/extras/e62e6392d86e045adff4291e4135a482.avif?t=1744728079\" /></div>Step 1) Hunt monsters with your monster hunters (Also: train them first so they don't die)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step 2) Craft them into awesome costumes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step 3) Sell them to people for money</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step 4) PROFIT!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918490/extras/44c3de91dd4a5c249a6f44cfbd953895.avif?t=1744728079\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage a team of 8 Spook Experts (read: grumpy part-time employees) in a world where the economy is run on selling the byproducts of a monster hunt. Don't think about the fact that the cute lil' unicorn costume you just sold was made from the hide of a bloodthirsty creature. That's just weird.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try to deal with customers the best you can! Upsell items! Train your staff! Try to avoid any (big) HR complaints!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Oh, did we mention that you have to do all this while keeping your sanity as the outside world falls further and further into a fascist state? Well, you do! (I don't know why we put an exclamation point right there. That's not funny)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918490/extras/80ebeb550f30a8dd46dde454c17c0211.avif?t=1744728079\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Train and utilize a staff of 8 through five acts of retail doom. Make sure that they have the stats to take on the day!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make sure that your team of 4 monster hunters have everything they need in order to bring home the best monsters the wilds have to offer! You don't want to sell BAD monster hides, now do you?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PC, Linux</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visual Novel with light RPG and Management elements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "short_description": "Hunt monsters! Turn those monsters into costumes! Profit! Try to keep your sanity while working a minimum wage seasonal retail job in a society quickly crumbling into a dictatorship!",
